# G6b: the toolbar, the formatting bar and the scroll bars. Select a word and switch Bold, Italic and Underline on through the
# Character menu (the buttons sink with a checkered face), centre the paragraph and turn bullets on, move into other paragraphs (the
# style, face and size boxes follow), then hide and show the toolbar, the formatting bar, the ruler and the status bar through the
# View menu (the page takes the rows and gives them back), page down and up (the scroll thumb moves) and leave.
@copy letter.rtf
@open LETTER.RTF
f8 right right right right right
f10 right right right right down enter
f10 right right right right down down enter
f10 right right right right down down down enter
esc
f10 right right right right right down enter
f10 right right right right right down down down down down down down enter
down down down down
f10 right right right right right right right enter
f10 right right right right right right right down enter
f10 right right right right right right right down down enter
f10 right right right right right right right down down down enter
f10 right right right right right right right enter
f10 right right right right right right right down enter
f10 right right right right right right right down down enter
f10 right right right right right right right down down down enter
pagedown pagedown
pageup
home
f10 end enter
right
enter
